## Common pitfalls

| Symptom | Cause / fix |
|---|---|
| `EUNKNOWN` on file edit | OneDrive sync lock. Wait 3s, retry. |
| Numbers don't scale weekly/monthly | Used unique-fleet `.size` instead of vehicle-days `vdReg/vdAdh/vdTot`. |
| KPI counts diverge across tabs | Reschedule predicate inconsistency. Verify `FSD ∈ {'False','NoFS'}` everywhere. |
| Date picker stuck | `calDates['<key>']` missing. Add to both JS init AND Python regeneration line. |
| Tab slider misaligned | Was using `getBoundingClientRect`. Use `offsetLeft/offsetWidth` (parent-relative). |
| Numbers show as `—` for new city | Add to `CITIES_ALLOWED` (JS) and `ALLOWED_CITIES` (Python). |
| `var(--blue)` invisible | Not defined. Use `--orange/indigo/purple/teal/green/red`. |

